  "version": "v1.7.0.4",
  "body": [
    {
      "from": 0.08,
      "to": 2.38,
      "sid": 1,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Today, I've come to the filming location of the movie 'The Truman Show'.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 2.38,
      "to": 5.02,
      "sid": 2,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's the seaside town of Seaside in Florida, home to 2,000 people.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 5.02,
      "to": 7.54,
      "sid": 3,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The small house in front of me is where Truman lived in the movie.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 7.54,
      "to": 9.26,
      "sid": 4,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Unfortunately, it hasn't been turned into a museum.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 9.26,
      "to": 10.66,
      "sid": 5,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Instead, it's private property.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 10.66,
      "to": 12.12,
      "sid": 6,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Sometimes, uh,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 15.32,
      "to": 16.76,
      "sid": 7,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and the road in front of this house,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 16.76,
      "to": 19.65,
      "sid": 8,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "is the same street that Truman walked down every day when he left his house.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 19.65,
      "to": 20.89,
      "sid": 9,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If you've seen the movie,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 20.89,
      "to": 22.51,
      "sid": 10,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Does this place feel familiar to you?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 22.51,
      "to": 25.14,
      "sid": 11,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although the houses don't look very large from the outside,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 25.14,
      "to": 27.1,
      "sid": 12,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "each one costs a few million dollars.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 27.1,
      "to": 27.9,
      "sid": 13,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's worth mentioning that,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 27.9,
      "to": 30.12,
      "sid": 14,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the house where Truman lived in the movie,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 30.12,
      "to": 32.92,
      "sid": 15,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "is where former Florida Representative Matt Gaetz",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 32.92,
      "to": 33.86,
      "sid": 16,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "grew up.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 33.86,
      "to": 34.66,
      "sid": 17,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "A few months ago,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 36.98,
      "to": 38.82,
      "sid": 18,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but due to Matt Gaetz's numerous scandals",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 38.82,
      "to": 39.92,
      "sid": 19,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He chose someone else",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 39.92,
      "to": 42.86,
      "sid": 20,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The ownership of Truman's house still lies with the Gates family",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 42.86,
      "to": 43.58,
      "sid": 21,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Matt Gates",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 43.58,
      "to": 46.07,
      "sid": 22,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He played the role of the elder Gates, a politician from Florida",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 46.07,
      "to": 47.79,
      "sid": 23,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The production team paid a significant amount of money to the mayor back then to film in the town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 47.79,
      "to": 49.45,
      "sid": 24,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They ended up building a house for Truman",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 49.45,
      "to": 50.99,
      "sid": 25,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "To serve as Truman's home",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 50.99,
      "to": 51.67,
      "sid": 26,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It’s unclear if there was any particular reason behind it",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 51.67,
      "to": 53.2,
      "sid": 27,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I wonder if there's some reason behind it.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 53.2,
      "to": 55.08,
      "sid": 28,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Taking a stroll around the town of Seaside",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 55.08,
      "to": 57.0,
      "sid": 29,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I feel the greenery here is really well done",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 57.0,
      "to": 58.86,
      "sid": 30,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Every few steps, you come across a park",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 58.86,
      "to": 61.46,
      "sid": 31,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Fountains and pools have dedicated staff to sweep up fallen leaves",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 61.46,
      "to": 62.18,
      "sid": 32,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although Seaside",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 62.18,
      "to": 64.379,
      "sid": 33,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "appears to be a historic Southern American town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 64.379,
      "to": 66.579,
      "sid": 34,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it’s actually a new development from the 1980s",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 66.579,
      "to": 68.479,
      "sid": 35,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a neo-traditional community inspired by New Urbanism",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 68.479,
      "to": 69.219,
      "sid": 36,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "following World War II",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 69.219,
      "to": 71.859,
      "sid": 37,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Most suburbs in America are centered around cars and highways.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 71.859,
      "to": 72.95,
      "sid": 38,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They have sprawled out without much order.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 72.95,
      "to": 76.01,
      "sid": 39,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The most representative features are wide roads and low-density single-family communities.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 76.01,
      "to": 78.15,
      "sid": 40,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Additionally, the land use planning in these suburbs",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 78.15,
      "to": 80.97,
      "sid": 41,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "forces residential areas to be separated from office and commercial zones.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 80.97,
      "to": 83.43,
      "sid": 42,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This leads to a reliance on cars for transportation.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 83.43,
      "to": 85.87,
      "sid": 43,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Friends who live in America should be well aware of this.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 85.87,
      "to": 87.33,
      "sid": 44,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The designers of Seaside Town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 87.33,
      "to": 89.8,
      "sid": 45,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "aimed to recreate a community as it was before the advent of the automobile.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 89.8,
      "to": 92.54,
      "sid": 46,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Communities where people can meet various needs by walking",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 92.54,
      "to": 94.12,
      "sid": 47,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Xixiade's design draws inspiration from many elements",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 94.12,
      "to": 96.26,
      "sid": 48,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "of America's historic Southern towns",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 96.26,
      "to": 98.1,
      "sid": 49,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "whether it's the retro architectural aesthetics",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 98.1,
      "to": 100.06,
      "sid": 50,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "or the city planning centered around walking",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 100.06,
      "to": 102.22,
      "sid": 51,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "all of which are quite different from the simultaneously developed suburbs",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 102.22,
      "to": 103.9,
      "sid": 52,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The production team of The Truman Show",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 103.9,
      "to": 105.74,
      "sid": 53,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "originally planned to shoot the movie in a studio",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 105.74,
      "to": 107.78,
      "sid": 54,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "as it was difficult to find a place in reality that is both modern",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 107.78,
      "to": 110.22,
      "sid": 55,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It also fulfills everyone's stereotypical image of an American small town.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 110.22,
      "to": 112.3,
      "sid": 56,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But back then, Peter Wyllie's wife was Wendy Stetz.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 112.3,
      "to": 114.3,
      "sid": 57,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "undoubtedly discovered Seaside in an architectural magazine,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 114.3,
      "to": 115.88,
      "sid": 58,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and pushed him towards Peter Well",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 115.88,
      "to": 116.96,
      "sid": 59,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After a site inspection,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 116.96,
      "to": 118.8,
      "sid": 60,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the production team immediately decided to choose this place.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 118.8,
      "to": 120.84,
      "sid": 61,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Why did the director think it was such a perfect fit?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 120.84,
      "to": 123.16,
      "sid": 62,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "A thorough online search turned up no relevant information,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 123.16,
      "to": 124.36,
      "sid": 63,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but instead, I stumbled upon a viral post.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 124.36,
      "to": 127.63,
      "sid": 64,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "When discussing the hottest Chinese AI product Quark on the internet recently",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 127.63,
      "to": 129.51,
      "sid": 65,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I thought, what if Quark AI knows?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 129.51,
      "to": 130.43,
      "sid": 66,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Quark's deep thinking",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 130.43,
      "to": 132.32,
      "sid": 67,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "quickly provided me with a step-by-step answer",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 132.32,
      "to": 133.88,
      "sid": 68,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "starting with the intricately designed residence",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 133.88,
      "to": 136.48,
      "sid": 69,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the unified and harmonious town of Seaside and the idyllic island controlling Truman",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 136.48,
      "to": 138.06,
      "sid": 70,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "this alignment with the Utopian setting",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 138.06,
      "to": 138.78,
      "sid": 71,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "then it mentioned",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 138.78,
      "to": 140.94,
      "sid": 72,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "that utilizing existing communities can significantly reduce costs",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 140.94,
      "to": 142.62,
      "sid": 73,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After analyzing these basic pieces of information",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 142.62,
      "to": 145.44,
      "sid": 74,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Quark linked the New Urbanism's reflection on modern urbanization issues",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 145.44,
      "to": 147.78,
      "sid": 75,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "with the film's critique of consumerism",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 147.78,
      "to": 148.66,
      "sid": 76,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and ultimately concluded",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 148.66,
      "to": 149.9,
      "sid": 77,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "that Ciside is more than just a filming location",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 149.9,
      "to": 151.8,
      "sid": 78,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it is also a concrete representation of the film's subject",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 151.8,
      "to": 152.74,
      "sid": 79,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Quark's analysis",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 152.74,
      "to": 155.12,
      "sid": 80,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "suddenly gave deeper meaning to the details I had overlooked",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 155.12,
      "to": 156.3,
      "sid": 81,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Quark is more than just a tool",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 156.3,
      "to": 158.98,
      "sid": 82,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's a super brain that can connect architecture and film.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 158.98,
      "to": 160.66,
      "sid": 83,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This hyper-dimensional cognitive ability",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 160.66,
      "to": 162.94,
      "sid": 84,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "stems from Alibaba's self-developed 32B large model.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 162.94,
      "to": 165.829,
      "sid": 85,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Unlike other AIs, which often face the awkward situation of busy servers,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 165.829,
      "to": 167.989,
      "sid": 86,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Quark always maintains its full-speed, high-performance state.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 167.989,
      "to": 170.309,
      "sid": 87,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I choose Quark because it's the easiest to use.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 170.309,
      "to": 171.36,
      "sid": 88,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And it's incredibly comprehensive,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 171.36,
      "to": 172.08,
      "sid": 89,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "suitable for all ages,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 172.08,
      "to": 173.06,
      "sid": 90,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "covering the entire group.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 173.06,
      "to": 174.76,
      "sid": 91,
